---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import Cta from '../../components/Cta.astro';
---
<Base
  title="ISO 42001 — psiberAI"
  description="Stand up responsible AI governance against ISO/IEC 42001, the AI-management-system standard — mapped to your real AI use cases. Vendor-neutral."
>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="ISO/IEC 42001"
    title="Govern your AI systems, responsibly."
    lead="ISO/IEC 42001 is the management-system standard for artificial intelligence. We help you stand up governance that's proportionate to your real use cases — enough to be defensible, never so heavy it stalls the work."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p>
        We help you establish an AI management system: define the scope and AI policy, run the AI risk
        and system-impact assessments the standard expects, select and implement the Annex A controls
        that fit your use cases, and build the Statement of Applicability and evidence base. The goal is
        governance that stands up to scrutiny — from customers, regulators and your own board — without
        becoming a tax on every model you ship.
      </p>

      <h2>Why it matters now</h2>
      <p>
        AI governance is moving quickly from optional to expected. Customers are adding it to vendor
        due-diligence, and regulation is arriving. ISO 42001 gives you a recognized framework to show
        you manage AI responsibly — and pairs naturally with an existing
        <a href="/services/iso-27001">ISO 27001</a> ISMS.
      </p>

      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Scoping &amp; AI policy</strong> — what's in the system, and the principles that govern it.</li>
        <li><strong>Risk &amp; impact assessment</strong> — AI-specific risks and system impacts, assessed against your use cases.</li>
        <li><strong>Controls &amp; SoA</strong> — the Annex A controls you need, documented and justified.</li>
        <li><strong>Readiness</strong> — preparation for certification or customer assurance.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Cta heading="Building AI into a regulated business?" body="Let's map an AI management system that's proportionate to your use cases and defensible to your stakeholders." button="Talk to us" />
</Base>
